OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order after gangs
OL,4,Aantisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order has been introduced
OL,7,Fin Lincoln city centre after gangs of
OL,8,Fyouths threatened people, threw chairs
OL,9,Faround, and made hoax 999 calls.
OL,11,FLincolnshire Police said incidents had
OL,12,Fbeen caught on CCTV over the weekend
OL,13,Fand, "despite continued engagement and
OL,14,Fintervention by officers, further
OL,15,Fincidents have continued to occur".
OL,17,FThe 48 hour dispersal order will remain
OL,18,Fin place until 21:38 BST on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
